    "1": "Because we have completed all previous steps (START), and have all necessary ingredients (fresh tofu), we can now do the step Cut-Cut 1/4 block or 3 ounces of fresh tofu into large cubes (about 1 in x 1 in). And now we have completed this step Cut-Cut 1/4 block or 3 ounces of fresh tofu into large cubes (about 1 in x 1 in).",
